  "statement": "Evaluate the sum\n\n\\[\\cos \\left(\\frac{2 \\pi}{18}\\right)+\\cos \\left(\\frac{4 \\pi}{18}\\right)+\\cdots+\\cos \\left(\\frac{34 \\pi}{18}\\right)\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
